warning: hex literal `0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF` exceeds the 64-bit integer range, so it wraps around to a different value
 --> Lua53:1:11
1 | local x = 0xFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFFF
  |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
help: use a smaller value or split across two values

warning: integer literal `9007199254740993` exceeds 2^53, so it loses precision when stored as a double
 --> Lua51:1:11
1 | local x = 9007199254740993
  |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
help: use a smaller value or store as a string

warning: decimal integer `99999999999999999999` exceeds 2^63-1, so it will be parsed as a float and lose precision
 --> Lua54:1:11
1 | local x = 99999999999999999999
  |           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
help: use a hex literal or split into smaller values
